# Global navigation and shared components (`public/components/`)

- **globalNav:** [`globalNav.html`](globalNav.html), [`globalNav.css`](globalNav.css), [`globalNav.js`](globalNav.js). Injected into `#globalNav` from [`public/js/app-initialization.js`](../js/app-initialization.js).
- **Desktop layout:** **[`.header-nav-cluster`](globalNav.html)** wraps **`.header-center`** + **`.header-right`**. **[`globalNav.css`](globalNav.css)** sets **`.header-nav-cluster { display: contents }`** so flex children behave like **logo \| centered view tabs \| user area** — **+ Deck** (**`#newDeckBtn`**) is the first child of **`.header-right`**, immediately left of **`#userMenu`**.
- **Mobile (`html.layout-mobile`):** Rules live in [`public/css/mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css) — not only `globalNav.css` `@media`. Full spec: **[`/MOBILE_DESIGN.md`](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) §10.1**.
  - **Two-row header:** **`.unified-header`** **`display: grid`** **`repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr))`** + two rows. **`.header-nav-cluster`**, **`.header-center`**, **`.header-app-actions`**, **`.app-tabs`**, **`.header-right`** use **`display: contents`**. **Row 1:** **`.header-left`** (logo, **`max-width: 134px`**, col 1) | **`#userMenu`** (cols 2–3, **`justify-self: end`**). **Row 2:** **`#databaseViewBtn`** | **`#collectionViewBtn`** | **`#deckBuilderBtn`** (equal); **`#newDeckBtn`** **`display: none`**.
  - **Collection hidden:** **[`syncHeaderCollectionLayout()`](globalNav.js)** sets **`display: none`** on Collection and adds **`.collection-tab-hidden`**: row 2 **Database** col 1, **Deck Builder** **`grid-column: 2 / 4`**.
  - **Welcome:** **`.user-menu-toggle`** **`justify-content: flex-end`**, **`width: auto`**. **Dropdown:** default **`display: none`**; **`.show`** → **`.layout-mobile .user-menu-dropdown.show`** **`display: grid`**, **`grid-template-columns: max-content`**, sizing on base **`.layout-mobile .user-menu-dropdown`** (no **`display`** there). **`.user-menu-item`** **`width: auto`**, **`white-space: nowrap`**, compact padding.
  - **Bar padding:** **`.unified-header`** **`padding: 8px 10px 8px`**; **`text-align: start`** beats narrow **`globalNav.css`** centering.
- **Z-index:** Global nav dropdowns, popups, and tooltips use **z-index: 9999** (see repo [.cursorrules](../../.cursorrules)).
- **Roadmap / milestones:** [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md).
